{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is found, approach and pick it up, move and check properties, process it or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
